---
// AboutSection.astro — About Archex: Purpose, Philosophy & Accountability
---

<section class="section-wrapper about-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Editorial Headline & Identity Statement -->
      <div class="about-left">
        <span class="tech-tag">About Archex</span>
        <h2 id="about-title" class="about-heading">
          Independent thinking.<br />
          Purposeful execution<span class="hl-dot">.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="about-statement">
          Archex brings together technology, creative thinking and go-to-market expertise to help ideas become meaningful products, experiences and businesses.
        </p>

        <div class="about-cta-box">
          <a href="/about" class="btn-base btn-secondary" title="Read in-depth about Archex">
            <span>Read full about Archex</span>
            <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Four Core Pillars of Archex -->
      <div class="about-right">
        <div class="about-pillars">
          <!-- Pillar 1 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">01</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Why Archex exists</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              Most projects struggle when business owners have to deal with separate developers, freelance designers, and marketing agencies who don't talk to each other. Archex solves this by bringing engineering, branding, and sales strategy under one roof.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Pillar 2 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">02</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">The thinking behind three practices</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              Instead of a generic agency that does a mediocre job at everything, Archex has three specialized practices: Craft (software), Studio (design), and GTM (growth). You get deep expertise in each field without the usual agency chaos.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Pillar 3 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">03</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Our approach to problem solving</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              We focus on what actually helps your business, not vanity trends. Every screen we design and every line of code we write is built to solve a real problem and give you a clear return on investment.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Pillar 4 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">04</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Thoughtful execution and accountability</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              Good ideas are useless without quality execution. We focus on reliability, clear deadlines, and long-term support, taking direct responsibility for what we build and deliver.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background-color: var(--paper-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.35fr;
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about-left {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-height) + 32px);
  }

  .about-heading {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 3.8vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hl-dot {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .about-statement {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 18.5px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-graphite);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .about-cta-box {
    padding-top: 16px;
  }

  /* Pillars Stack */
  .about-pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background-color: var(--paper-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 32px);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .pillar-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pillar-index {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--signal);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.4vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pillar-body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-graphite);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about-left {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>

